{"verse_key": "10:94", "surah": 10, "verse": 94, "text_uthmani": "فَإِن كُنتَ فِى شَكٍّ مِّمَّآ أَنزَلْنَآ إِلَيْكَ فَسْـَٔلِ ٱلَّذِينَ يَقْرَءُونَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ مِن قَبْلِكَ ۚ لَقَدْ جَآءَكَ ٱلْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّكَ فَلَا تَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ", "translation": "So if you are in doubt, [O Muḥammad], about that which We have revealed to you, then ask those who have been reading the Scripture before you. The truth has certainly come to you from your Lord, so never be among the doubters.", "verse_from_ms": 2048170, "verse_to_ms": 2076510, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَإِن", "start_ms": 2048170, "end_ms": 2049740}, {"i": 1, "text": "كُنتَ", "start_ms": 2049740, "end_ms": 2051000}, {"i": 2, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 2051000, "end_ms": 2051380}, {"i": 3, "text": "شَكٍّ", "start_ms": 2051380, "end_ms": 2052410}, {"i": 4, "text": "مِّمَّآ", "start_ms": 2052410, "end_ms": 2055380}, {"i": 5, "text": "أَنزَلْنَآ", "start_ms": 2055380, "end_ms": 2058540}, {"i": 6, "text": "إِلَيْكَ", "start_ms": 2058540, "end_ms": 2059380}, {"i": 7, "text": "فَسْـَٔلِ", "start_ms": 2059380, "end_ms": 2060170}, {"i": 8, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 2060170, "end_ms": 2061050}, {"i": 9, "text": "يَقْرَءُونَ", "start_ms": 2061050, "end_ms": 2062020}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "start_ms": 2062020, "end_ms": 2063270}, {"i": 11, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 2063270, "end_ms": 2064030}, {"i": 12, "text": "قَبْلِكَ", "start_ms": 2064030, "end_ms": 2065770}, {"i": 13, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 2065770, "end_ms": 2066420}, {"i": 14, "text": "لَقَدْ", "start_ms": 2066420, "end_ms": 2068480}, {"i": 15, "text": "جَآءَكَ", "start_ms": 2068480, "end_ms": 2069270}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلْحَقُّ", "start_ms": 2069270, "end_ms": 2069530}, {"i": 17, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 2069530, "end_ms": 2070460}, {"i": 18, "text": "رَّبِّكَ", "start_ms": 2070460, "end_ms": 2071000}, {"i": 19, "text": "فَلَا", "start_ms":